Reed [neutral]: The steps are swept. The shell's cut. There's nothing left to do but wait. #line:ch02_bark_chapel_listen_001
Rhen [neutral]: Wait for what? #line:ch02_bark_chapel_listen_002
Reed [soft_smile]: The tide. It always comes. #line:ch02_bark_chapel_listen_003
